Z||000050||California Kid||12-12-2001||05:03 PM||||[QUOTE]Originally posted by RedHaze86SD4:<BR>[B]And my RedHaze project car. ooo ooo It gets repainted black this weekend   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>********************************************<BR>Your choice....But you should think it over real good, the plastic panels have dust collecting force unlike metal bodied cars. Mine was Black, I would dust it off and 15 minutes later it looks bad again. This is a real pain at shows!!!! Also, if they don't "block sand" every panel on your car, it will show every dip and weave in the body panels which changes with the temperature. Just thought I'd let you know.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/californiakidsig_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
